{
  "conceptual": "\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\"><strong sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Demon's Cove</strong> is a small arena shooter. The player survives as long as possible on a floating platform while waves of enemies attack. Daggers kill the enemies, enemies drop gems and collected gems upgrade the player's weapon.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\"><img src=\"~/pages/samples/media/demons-cove.jpg\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\" alt=\"Demon's Cove\"></p>\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">The game was built by an AI agent using the editor's <a href=\"~/pages/docs/tools/mcp-server.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">MCP server</a>. Starting from a few provided assets, the agent set up the project, imported the assets, wrote the C++ game plugin and iterated on the gameplay until it worked. The game design is a replica of <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/422970/Devil_Daggers\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">Devil Daggers</a> by Sorath.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">The sample can be downloaded directly from the ezEditor <a href=\"~/pages/docs/editor/dashboard.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">dashboard</a>. It contains a C++ plugin, which the editor offers to compile when the project is opened. Afterwards open <code sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">Scenes/Main.ezScene</code> and <a href=\"~/pages/docs/editor/run-scene.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">play the game</a>.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">The controls, enemy types, debug CVars and the code structure are described in the <a href=\"https://github.com/jankrassnigg/demons-cove\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">GitHub repository</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"see-also\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"13\">See Also</h2>\n<ul sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"15\">\n<li sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"15\"><a href=\"~/pages/samples/samples-overview.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"15\">Samples</a></li>\n<li sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"16\"><a href=\"~/pages/docs/tools/mcp-server.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"16\">MCP Server</a></li>\n<li sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"17\"><a href=\"~/pages/docs/editor/dashboard.md\" sourcefile=\"pages/samples/demons-cove.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"17\">Dashboard</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
